1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,526
Quality is built in two ways.

2
00:00:02,526 --> 00:00:09,062
Quality assurance improves the process to prevent defects: standards, reviews and audits.

3
00:00:09,062 --> 00:00:12,278
Quality control tests the product to detect them.

4
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:17,044
Similarly, verification asks: are we building the product right?

5
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:20,598
Validation asks: are we building the right product?

